=== Triangle

Let the length of the sides of the triangle be $a$, $b$, $c$.

==== Semiperimeter

Let $p$ be the semiperimeter defined as:

$ p = (a + b + c)/2 $

==== Area

Let $A$ be the area defined as:

$ A = sqrt(p(p-a)(p-b)(p-c)) $

==== Circumradius

$ R = (a b c)/(4A) $

==== Inradius

$ r = A/p $

==== Length of bisector

$ s_a = sqrt(b c [1 - (a/(b+c))^2]) $

==== Law of sines

$ (sin alpha)/a = (sin beta)/b = (sin gamma)/c = 1/(2R) $

==== Law of cosines

$ a^2 = b^2 + c^2 - 2b c cos alpha $

==== Law of tangents

$ (a+b)/(a-b) = (tan (alpha+beta)/2)/(tan (alpha-beta)/2) $
